sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant B as Backend
  participant W as Writer (Opus)
  participant PN as Panel x3 (Opus)
  participant AU as Auditors x5 (Haiku)
  participant DB as db.json
  U->>B: Paste a JD
  B->>DB: Read saved profile
  DB-->>B: Profile and resume
  par Match analysis
    B->>W: Write the analysis
    W-->>B: Analysis
    B->>AU: Audit it, check quotes
    AU-->>B: Scores and issues
  and Reviewer scores
    B->>PN: Score the resume
    PN-->>B: Three scores
    B->>AU: Audit the scores
    AU-->>B: Scores and issues
  end
  opt A lane fails its audit
    B->>W: Rewrite once
    W-->>B: Corrected output
    B->>AU: Audit again
    AU-->>B: Final audit result
  end
  B->>B: Gate: average 80+ and lowest 70+
  B->>DB: Save the record
  B-->>U: Result and apply tier
